# Nexraft Redesign Design System

Foundation for the visual redesign. Use these tokens and rules for all new or
redesigned sections. Tokens live in the `@theme` block of `app/globals.css`
(Tailwind v4) and become utilities automatically.

## Colors

Defined as `--color-*` in the `app/globals.css` `@theme` block. Use the
generated utilities, never raw hex.

| Token | Hex | Role | Utility |
|-------|-----|------|---------|
| ink | #0A0E0C | Page background | `bg-ink` |
| ink2 | #0E1310 | Cards / panels | `bg-ink2` |
| panel | #10160F | Hover / popular panel | `bg-panel` |
| line | #1E2723 | Hairline borders + grid | `border-line` |
| bone | #E8EDE9 | Primary text (never pure white) | `text-bone` |
| soft | #D0D8D4 | Nav links, secondary CTAs | `text-soft` |
| mute | #C4CCC8 | Body secondary / descriptions | `text-mute` |
| faint | #B4BEB8 | Captions, ticker, stats labels | `text-faint` |
| tag | #C8D0CC | Tech stack tags | `text-tag` |
| signal | #43D085 | Accent (see rule below) | `text-signal` / `bg-signal` |
| signal-dim | #309660 | Small accent text / eyebrows | `text-signal-dim` |

Use `signal` ONLY on: the primary CTA, active cursor nodes, status dots, and the
founding-rate badge. Everything else stays in the ink/bone/mute range. Keep the
accent rare so it reads as a signal.

## Type

Loaded via `next/font/google` in `app/layout.tsx`, exposed as Tailwind utilities
through `@theme`.

- Space Grotesk: display font, weights 400-700, utility `font-grotesk`.
- JetBrains Mono: labels, data, and eyebrows, utility `font-jetbrains`.
- Display headlines: tight leading, `letter-spacing: -0.03em`.
- All-caps eyebrows and spec labels (e.g. "03 / SERVICES", "GRID_REF A1"):
  JetBrains Mono, 11px, `letter-spacing: 0.2em`.

The live site still uses `font-display` / `font-body` / `font-mono`. Do not
repoint those existing tokens.

## Layout

- Max content width 1180px with 28px gutters.
- Separate sections with a 1px `var(--color-line)` top border.
- Vertical padding around 120px on desktop, 84px on mobile.
- Zero or minimal border-radius. The brand is "built like infrastructure":
  squared and precise.

## Motion

- Standard easing: `cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)`.
- Deliberate, not everywhere. Motion should feel intentional.
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: disable the mesh loop and scroll
  reveals.

## Project guardrails

- Tailwind v4: design tokens live in the `@theme` block of `app/globals.css`.
  There is NO `tailwind.config`. Add new tokens there.
- Never mention "Vercel" in site copy. Use "managed edge infrastructure" or
  "global edge network".
- ASCII-only copy. No em-dashes, no smart quotes. Past builds broke on
  non-ASCII bytes.
- Primary CTA links go to https://cal.com/nexraft/discovery-call.
